# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Python bytecode.  `src/probing/`, `src/data/` and `src/activations/` are declared as
# stage dependencies, so without this every import rewrites a .pyc inside them, changes
# the directory hash, and makes `dvc repro` delete and rebuild the probes — running
# pytest was enough to trigger it.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
